WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The delay was fitted on a chirp. These reversal observations were withheld; read the frozen delay and held-out RMSE.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.100
The Oracle, initial model, and identified model are drawn in order on the same position axis.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.100
White is the Oracle, orange the initial model, blue the identified model. The axes show radians and seconds.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.100
The blue trace overlaps truth. This supports prediction under known mechanics, fixed PD, and ideal observations.
